#: scenario8:scenario8_ECD0EA2D_CADC_476B_802B_330AC5782E94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d28eaf5560c35b2031d078904378aedae2000ee6b12b068ee1b9c92f87ee4b4
